<title>USA: Agri Int'l buys one mln more Golden Poultry shrs.</title>
<headline>Agri Int'l buys one mln more Golden Poultry shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agri International Inc said Thursday it will buy up to one million more shares of Golden Poultry Co Inc common within the next year.</p>
<p>Agri International is a subsidiary of Gold Kist Inc, a private cooperative owned by 40,000 farmers. Its holdings include about 73 percent of the stock of Golden Poultry Co.</p>
